{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1791969205","published":"2026-10-14T09:13:36Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:14.017910078Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-19445"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-19445","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free in the SNI servername callback when the\n     callback switches the connection to another SSLContext\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-19445.patch: look the SSLContext up from the\n       connection with SSL_get_app_data() and hold strong references to it and\n       to the Python callback for the duration of _servername_callback() in\n       Modules/_ssl.c, instead of the borrowed pointer registered with\n       SSL_CTX_set_tlsext_servername_arg(), which the callback itself releases\n       when it assigns SSLSocket.context; stop registering that argument in\n       set_servername_callback() and unregister the servername callback in\n       context_dealloc() so an SSL_CTX that outlives its SSLContext as a\n       connection's session_ctx leaves no Python callback behind\n     - CVE-2026-19445","affected":[{"package":{"name":"idle-python2.7","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/idle-python2.7?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.7.18-8+deb11u1+tuxcare.els6"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1791969205.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpython2.7","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpython2.7?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.7.18-8+deb11u1+tuxcare.els6"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1791969205.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpython2.7-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpython2.7-dev?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.7.18-